+`EnvGuard`/`ScopedFlag` (test_support, passes/mod, loop_align, vec_interleave,
+vec_load_sink, location_alloc/policy), `TriStateFlagWindow` and
+`RestorePointerSize`, `EnvWindow`, `Target::set`, `LateMinMaxOnlyScope`, plus one
