+| benchmark | Ir base | Ir new | new/base |
+| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
+| `zlib_ng_adler32` | 396,349,526 | 383,790,936 | **0.96831** |
+| 30 others | — | — | 1.00000 (±1.5e-5 layout noise on five of them) |
